Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.58,0:21:15.92,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}My feelings are ready to burst forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.25,0:21:21.00,ed-romaji,,0000,0000,0000,karaoke,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf12}U{\kf27}ta{\kf28}e {\kf73}lai{\kf58} {\kf75}lai{\kf30} {\kf171}lai!
