Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.51,0:21:31.43,ed-romaji,,0000,0000,0000,karaoke,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf92}Mou {\kf67}high{\kf64} {\kf68}high{\kf32} {\kf120}high!
