Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.43,0:21:37.02,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}Riding the whirling winds...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.02,0:21:41.44,ed-romaji,,0000,0000,0000,karaoke,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf18}U{\kf27}ta{\kf28}e {\kf73}lai{\kf58} {\kf75}lai{\kf30} {\kf171}lai!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.02,0:21:41.44,ed-kanji,,0000,0000,0000,karaoke,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf45}歌{\kf28}え {\kf73}lai{\kf58} {\kf75}lai{\kf30} {\kf171}lai!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.02,0:21:41.44,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}Sing out, lai lai lai!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.86,0:21:47.36,ed-romaji,,0000,0000,0000,karaoke,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf56}Ko{\kf34}e {\kf30}mo {\kf34}to{\kf98}bi{\kf67}ha{\kf53}ne{\kf177}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.86,0:21:47.36,ed-kanji,,0000,0000,0000,karaoke,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf90}声{\kf30}も{\kf34}飛{\kf98}び{\kf67}跳{\kf53}ね{\kf177}る
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.86,0:21:47.36,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}My voice swoops up and down with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.12,0:00:27.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.70,0:00:40.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.76,0:00:42.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was just about to get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.75,0:00:46.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.54,0:00:50.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop worrying already.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.92,0:00:54.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll begin negotiations with them next week, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.61,0:00:57.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.69,0:01:06.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Last night, my grandfather on my mother's side passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.38,0:01:10.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Were the people in that dream...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.69,0:01:14.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...Granddad and Mum?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Apparently, he had fallen out of touch with his relatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.94,0:01:51.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Geez. The first time I've been back here in forever, and it's for a funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.03,0:04:26.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.87,0:04:30.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Daikichi. You're early.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.04,0:04:32.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can leave your bag in Granddad's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.29,0:04:33.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.71,0:04:36.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,By the way, I saw a girl in the garden...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.38,0:04:38.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't remember her. Did Haruko's kid look like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.55,0:04:42.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That isn't Reina-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.30,0:04:44.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then whose kid is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.34,0:04:50.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Geez. This kitchen is so awkward...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.06,0:04:59.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.65,0:05:02.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He went pretty peacefully for someone who lived to be 79.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.69,0:05:06.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Apparently, that girl is your grandfather's illegitimate child.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.28,0:05:07.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh!?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.86,0:05:10.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Granddad's kid!?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.33,0:05:13.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He never told me anything about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.83,0:05:17.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And apparently, his lover took off, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.04,0:05:20.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Lover? The guy was 79, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.34,0:05:23.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's so embarrassing and shameful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.88,0:05:27.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then that makes her your little sister, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.72,0:05:30.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And my aunt, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.55,0:05:32.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not a joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.47,0:05:37.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're thirty years old now! Try to be a bit more sensitive!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.92,0:06:05.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You went peacefully, didn't you, Granddad?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.90,0:06:28.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How much should I give?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.70,0:06:32.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's entirely up to you. Give as much or as little as you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.28,0:06:35.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But surely, you must expect a certain amount.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.79,0:06:38.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really, however much you wish to give would be appreciated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.37,0:06:42.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Though the custom these days is to have some Buddhist scriptures read...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.29,0:06:44.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...and a posthumous Buddhist name conferred on the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.01,0:06:50.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She said it'd cost between 400,000 and 500,000 yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.26,0:06:52.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's a fair amount.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.47,0:06:55.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello. It's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.68,0:06:58.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Daikichi. It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.68,0:07:00.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Have you been keeping busy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.52,0:07:02.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.23,0:07:06.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Too busy to make time for his dear mother, who longs to see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.90,0:07:09.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't even make it back for New Year.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.12,0:07:15.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, Reina! {SO CUTE!}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.95,0:07:20.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.91,0:07:21.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.50,0:07:24.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Dai-chan. It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.58,0:07:24.75,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Mum!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.09,0:07:26.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.34,0:07:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.34,0:07:32.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Be a good girl and sit quietly, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.18,0:07:34.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.84,0:07:34.09,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.09,0:07:35.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.06,0:07:42.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You really are just like your grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.82,0:07:52.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.03,0:07:53.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, Mum told me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.91,0:07:56.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.20,0:08:00.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure my brother was lonely, since he lived on his own, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.54,0:08:02.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Apparently, they found a Baby Book...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.75,0:08:04.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...with the name "Rin" in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.83,0:08:08.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But pulling something like that at the age of 79...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.80,0:08:11.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, putting aside whether or not he's her father,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.51,0:08:15.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,you've got to hand it to the old guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.43,0:08:20.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, can you get the cushions out of the closet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.38,0:08:51.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.94,0:09:13.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.82,0:09:16.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll trade you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.32,0:09:20.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No! Leave it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.41,0:09:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.42,0:09:32.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Look, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.00,0:09:34.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Reina, don't run around!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.09,0:09:36.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.80,0:09:37.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it pretty?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.84,0:09:42.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course! You're awfully good at cat's cradle, Reina-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.27,0:09:47.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Try and do a four step ladder next!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.48,0:09:53.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My, my. Reina-chan... Pass it to me a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.57,0:09:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Poo bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.40,0:09:56.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop that, Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.95,0:10:47.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uncle. Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.37,0:10:50.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.21,0:10:52.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll handle the incense for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.17,0:10:54.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.84,0:10:59.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, don't sleep there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.51,0:11:03.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go and get some rest there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.14,0:11:04.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What about the incense?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.43,0:11:07.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi says he'll keep an eye on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.52,0:11:09.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.64,0:11:13.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Keep an eye on my brother, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.15,0:11:22.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should go through and sleep, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.53,0:11:26.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.91,0:11:30.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You look awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.77,0:11:55.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, then, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.81,0:11:59.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please say your last good-byes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.57,0:12:05.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Say hello to your mother for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.74,0:12:06.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Granddad...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.78,0:12:11.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll see you soon enough.{Jeez, that's macabre. :'D Like "Don't worry, I'll be dead soon too!"}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.66,0:12:15.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Reina, time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.00,0:12:16.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.46,0:12:20.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's time to say good-bye to Granddad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.96,0:12:22.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.89,0:12:30.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A field of flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.77,0:12:32.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.27,0:12:37.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No! I'm going to make a field of flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.81,0:12:40.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to make one!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.32,0:12:51.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should come and say good-bye, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.39,0:13:14.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Put these on Granddad.{;__;}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.44,0:13:25.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.84,0:13:43.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bellflowers...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.84,0:13:43.38,Note,,0000,0000,0000,,TL Note: In Japanese, bellflowers are 'Rindou'.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.55,0:13:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Granddad's favourite flowers...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.94,0:14:10.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He'd be happiest with these flowers, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.12,0:14:16.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is he never going to wake up?{;_______;}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.17,0:14:26.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No. He'll never wake up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.68,0:14:41.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You really are his kid, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.81,0:16:04.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So what happened to this "Yoshii Masako"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.48,0:16:07.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think tracking down someone who abandoned their child...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.44,0:16:10.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...will really lead to much good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.74,0:16:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How irresponsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.78,0:16:17.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And my brother stubbornly refused to say a word about it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.09,0:16:36.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.43,0:16:39.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That girl can't talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.64,0:16:40.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's such a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.81,0:16:43.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And she hasn't even lost her baby teeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.02,0:16:44.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She can, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.77,0:16:46.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And she's not a pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.44,0:16:47.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She can't talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.94,0:16:52.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So I'm so bored!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.61,0:16:57.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here. Take them all and go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.45,0:17:00.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're like a sweet shop owner!{XD!}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.83,0:17:03.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.91,0:17:05.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Never mind any long-term plans,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.92,0:17:08.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,who's going to take care of her {\i1}now{\i0}?{Italics please. :D}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.17,0:17:12.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't. We have a shop to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.17,0:17:16.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If she were just a little less strange...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.01,0:17:18.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And it looks like she hasn't even started to speak yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.76,0:17:22.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mum, you're at home all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.10,0:17:24.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can't you take her for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.14,0:17:27.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,T-There's no way I can do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.77,0:17:30.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have the time for something like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.77,0:17:34.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you even know how difficult it is to raise a child?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.15,0:17:39.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And how much I've already sacrificed?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.20,0:17:42.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you can't properly take care of her, it'd be less cruel not to bother at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.24,0:17:48.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't we supposed to be finding somebody to take her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.04,0:17:53.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like you're planning to do anything yourself, Onii-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.00,0:17:55.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Try to look at things a bit more realistically.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.05,0:18:01.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, we don't even know whether she really is Granddad's child.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.68,0:18:06.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing to say, right? Bet you haven't even thought it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.38,0:18:41.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.09,0:18:44.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I suggest contacting facilities that will take her off our hands immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.85,0:18:53.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.62,0:19:05.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.92,0:19:22.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Want to come stay with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.59,0:19:24.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.01,0:19:25.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Onii-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.23,0:20:15.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gramps, I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.90,0:20:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,G-Gramps?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.44,0:20:20.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't call me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.65,0:20:26.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're the one who's my aunt!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.84,0:22:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it good?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.30,0:22:05.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.43,0:22:10.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Seconds?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.68,0:22:11.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.89,0:22:14.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothing left to go with the rice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.27,0:22:16.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll make rice balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.68,0:22:18.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have the tools to make them, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.77,0:22:20.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Salt!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.98,0:22:22.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Salt?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.69,0:22:28.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! It's still hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.15,0:22:29.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.74,0:22:34.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But it'll have a gentle flavour.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.54,0:22:37.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go, Gramps!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.08,0:22:40.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry. Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.54,0:22:42.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"Daikichi" sounds weird, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.51,0:22:49.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's good.
